msgid "Panel"
msgstr "面板目錄"

msgid "Could not read the dae service state."
msgstr "讀取 dae 服務狀態失敗。"

msgid "If luci-app-dae was installed just now, restart rpcd so that its backend is registered."
msgstr "如果剛安裝 luci-app-dae，請重啟 rpcd 使其後端生效。"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "執行中"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "未啟用"

msgid "Open panel"
msgstr "開啟面板"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "啟動"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重啟"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "狀態"

msgid "Listener"
msgstr "監聽位址"

msgid "The dae service is disabled."
msgstr "dae 服務目前未啟用。"

msgid "The dae service is not running."
msgstr "dae 服務未執行。"

msgid "The panel files are missing. Reinstall the luci-app-dae package."
msgstr "面板檔案缺少，請重新安裝 luci-app-dae 套件。"

msgid "The panel is not reachable from this browser."
msgstr "目前的瀏覽器連不到面板。"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服務"

msgid "Start at boot"
msgstr "開機自啟"

msgid "Configuration write"
msgstr "允許寫入設定"

msgid "Configuration write lets the panel save changes to the dae configuration files."
msgstr "開啟後，面板可以透過 API 把變更寫回 dae 的設定檔。"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "讀取中…"

msgid "Show"
msgstr "顯示"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "複製"

msgid "The secret is not available to this session."
msgstr "目前的工作階段無權讀取金鑰。"

msgid "Copied"
msgstr "已複製"

msgid "API secret"
msgstr "API 金鑰"

msgid "The panel asks for this secret the first time it is opened. It is also readable with: uci get dae.main.api_secret"
msgstr "面板首次開啟時會要求輸入這個金鑰。也可以用 uci get dae.main.api_secret 讀取。"

msgid "Working…"
msgstr "處理中…"

msgid "The operation completed."
msgstr "操作已完成。"

msgid "The operation failed."
msgstr "操作失敗。"

msgid "dae"
msgstr "dae 引擎"

msgid "The doona panel drives the dae engine over its native HTTP API. dae serves the panel itself; this page shows the service state and opens the panel."
msgstr "doona 面板透過 dae 的原生 HTTP API 驅動引擎。面板由 dae 自己託管，本頁顯示服務狀態並負責開啟面板。"

msgid "The dae service is enabled but not running."
msgstr "dae 服務已啟用，但目前未執行。"

msgid "The API secret is missing. Restart the service to generate one."
msgstr "缺少 API 金鑰，重新啟動服務即可自動產生。"

msgid "The API listens on the router itself, so the panel is not reachable from another machine."
msgstr "API 只監聽路由器本機，其他機器連不到面板。"

msgid "The API listener address is invalid. Check dae.main.api_listen."
msgstr "API 監聽位址不合法，請檢查 dae.main.api_listen。"

msgid "The dae service started."
msgstr "dae 服務已啟動。"

msgid "The dae service stopped."
msgstr "dae 服務已停止。"

msgid "The dae service restarted."
msgstr "dae 服務已重新啟動。"

msgid "The dae service starts at boot."
msgstr "dae 服務已設為開機自啟。"

msgid "The dae service no longer starts at boot."
msgstr "dae 服務已取消開機自啟。"

msgid "The dae service did not start. Check the system log."
msgstr "dae 服務啟動失敗，請查看系統記錄。"

msgid "The dae service did not stop. Check the system log."
msgstr "dae 服務停止失敗，請查看系統記錄。"

msgid "The dae service did not restart. Check the system log."
msgstr "dae 服務重新啟動失敗，請查看系統記錄。"

msgid "The dae service was not enabled. Check the system log."
msgstr "dae 服務啟用失敗，請查看系統記錄。"

msgid "The operation is not known."
msgstr "未知操作。"

msgid "The dae service reported an issue."
msgstr "dae 服務回報了一個問題。"

msgid "The backend did not confirm the operation."
msgstr "後端沒有確認這次操作。"

msgid "Apply"
msgstr "套用"

msgid "The listener address was saved and the service was restarted."
msgstr "監聽位址已儲存，服務已重啟。"

msgid "The listener address was saved. It takes effect at the next start."
msgstr "監聽位址已儲存，下次啟動後生效。"

msgid "The listener address is invalid. Use a numeric address and a port between 1 and 65535."
msgstr "監聽位址無效，請使用數字位址和 1 至 65535 之間的連接埠。"

msgid "The request was not understood."
msgstr "無法辨識的要求。"

msgid "The settings could not be written. Check the system log."
msgstr "設定寫入失敗，請查看系統記錄。"

msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隱藏"

msgid "The configuration write permission was saved and the service was restarted."
msgstr "設定寫入權限已儲存，服務已重啟。"

msgid "The configuration write permission was saved. It takes effect at the next start."
msgstr "設定寫入權限已儲存，下次啟動後生效。"

msgid "The value is not valid."
msgstr "該值無效。"

msgid "The secret could not be written to the clipboard. It is shown instead."
msgstr "密鑰没能寫入剪貼簿，已改為直接顯示。"
